{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然ですが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーランドでのオススメグルメ\n第1位は\nトゥモローランド内の\nパン・ギャラティック・ピザ・ポートの\nシーフードクリームのカルツォーネです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張全握 横浜個握\nありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張全握は人・人・人！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セブンライブでは\n何空 咄嗟 おいシャン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握ミニライブでは\n別れ際"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出ました～♡\n見つけられたかな？＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香さんの握手を見て学びたかったけど\nそんな暇ない位混んでいたので残念(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香さんファンの皆様\nとても優しくて楽しい握手を\nありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜個握ありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの個握に\nすごくすごくテンションあがったよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は次のシングルの握手会から\n部数が減ります。\n久しぶりにすごく悔しい出来事です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会が1番好きなお仕事なのに...><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の横浜個握も\nかなり列が伸びていたので\nどうして部数が減ってしまったのか\n私には分かりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私は変わらず、\n来てくださった方を\n最高に楽しい空間で出迎える！\n満足感のある握手にする！\nこれをモットーに次のシングルも\n楽しんでいきたいと思いますので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様よろしければ\n私のレーンにも遊びに来てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後悔はさせません(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- TV --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎将棋フォーカス   NHK Eテレ\n毎週日曜10:00～\n(再)毎週木曜15:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎NOGIBINGO!5 日本テレビ\n9月14日(月)25:29～25:59"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- 雑誌/新聞 --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ダ・ヴィンチ 発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎将棋世界 10月号 発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎EX大衆 10月号 9月15日発売\n花奈さん真洋さんと乃木坂表題曲の\n振り付けについて解説しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂46×週刊プレイボーイ2015 9月17日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアーの密着撮影を\nゆっちゃんと担当した記事と\n伊藤かりんの握手会ガイドという記事の\n2つに載せていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎B.L.T 11月号 9月24日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈とアンダーライブについて\n話させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎UTB+  10月9日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季刊 乃木坂以来のソログラビアです！\n呼んでいただけて本当に嬉しいです！！\n詳しくはまた告知します！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂版nanacoカードを\nセブンイレブンさんに頂いたよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいでしょ～？(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/09/14/4048252/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}